    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d194-a2">

                <pb facs="0364" n="248" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg248"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2—Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Gauss to Chargé MacMurray.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate General</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 23, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>It has been ascertained that the Chinese version of the judgment in the Vaseline
                    case does not agree with that of the assessor, but confirms the Japanese
                    contention. Investigating.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
